                        9. What Are the Common Reasons Behind Latvia Study Visa Rejections?
                    </h2>

                    <p style="line-height:1.8;">
                        Although Latvia welcomes international students, not every application is approved.
                    </p>

                    <p style="line-height:1.8;">
