                    </p>

                    <h4>Incomplete Documentation</h4>
                    <p>
                        Missing paperwork remains one of the leading causes of delays and rejections.
                    </p>

                    <h4>Weak Financial Evidence</h4>
                    <p>
                        Students must clearly demonstrate financial capability.
                    </p>

                    <h4>Inconsistent Information</h4>
                    <p>
                        Details provided across forms and supporting documents should match accurately.
                    </p>

                    <h4>Unclear Academic Intentions</h4>
                    <p>
                        Applicants should be able to explain why they have selected a specific programme and
                        institution.
                    </p>

                    <h4>Last-Minute Applications</h4>
                    <p>
                        Rushed submissions often contain avoidable mistakes.
                    </p>

                    <p style="line-height:1.8;">
                        Students who prepare early and submit a well-organised application generally place
                        themselves in a stronger position for approval.
                    </p>
                </div>

